Epic 2: Template Generator

Story 5: Build base template engine for canary generation

Story Points: 5

Description:
Create the core template generation engine that builds CloudWatch Synthetics scripts from predefined templates and request parameters. The engine should support injecting values such as URL, environment, team, and schedule into reusable script patterns. This is the primary value of the platform and should work fully without AI.

Acceptance Criteria:
	•	Template engine generates script from selected template
	•	Dynamic values are injected correctly
	•	Output script is readable and valid
	•	Template generation works without AI dependency
	•	Errors in missing template inputs are handled clearly

