Story 6: Build standard URL validation template

Story Points: 2

Description:
Create a reusable template for simple page availability checks. This template should open the target URL, wait for page load, verify response or page state, and log success or failure. This provides a quick onboarding path for teams that need simple synthetic coverage.

Acceptance Criteria:
	•	Template supports a target URL input
	•	Script performs page load validation
	•	Script includes success and failure logging
	•	Script can be generated repeatedly with different URLs
	•	Template output passes basic validation checks

