Story 7: Build API endpoint validation template

Story Points: 3

Description:
Create a reusable API canary template that validates an HTTP endpoint response. The template should support method, headers, response code check, and optional response body validation. This enables teams to monitor service endpoints without browser-based logic.

Acceptance Criteria:
	•	Template supports API endpoint input
	•	Template supports method selection
	•	Template supports expected response code validation
	•	Optional header input is supported
	•	Generated script validates endpoint response correctly

