Story 8: Build SSO page starter template

Story Points: 5

Description:
Create a predefined starter template for SSO-based login pages. The goal is to support common enterprise login journeys where a user is redirected to a central login page before reaching the application. The template should include a structured approach for entering credentials, submitting the login form, waiting for the redirect, and validating arrival on the target page. This should be positioned as a best-effort supported flow, since SSO implementations vary by application.

Acceptance Criteria:
	•	Template supports SSO login page URL
	•	Template supports username and password field handling pattern
	•	Template supports post-login landing page validation
	•	Template clearly separates configurable selectors and values
	•	Known limitations for custom SSO flows are documented

