Story 9: Build exchange API endpoint token-access template

Story Points: 6

Description:
Create a template for scenarios where the canary must call an exchange API endpoint to obtain access to another application before validating a page or API. This template should support requesting a token or session credential from an exchange endpoint, storing the response value in memory during execution, and reusing it in subsequent requests or browser interactions. This is important for enterprise applications that require pre-authentication or delegated access flow before monitoring.

Acceptance Criteria:
	•	Template supports exchange API endpoint input
	•	Template can send request to obtain token or access credential
	•	Returned token can be used in subsequent API request or page flow
	•	Sensitive values are not hardcoded in script
	•	Generated script clearly separates token retrieval step from validation step

